 ## 0.4.0
 
diff -ruN -x __pycache__ -x .pytest_cache -x _hidden a/docs/api.md b/docs/api.md
--- a/docs/api.md	2026-11-12 01:26:27
+++ b/docs/api.md	2026-11-12 02:29:44
@@ -11,6 +11,9 @@
 
 - `shipments.create_shipment(customer_id, weight_kg, zone)`: book a shipment
 - `shipments.get_shipment(shipment_id)`: fetch one shipment
+- `shipments.mark_returned(shipment_id)`: record that a shipment came back to the depot. Sets status to "returned" and `returned_at` to the current time, emits `shipment.returned`, and returns the shipment. Idempotent: a shipment that is already "returned" is returned unchanged, with no event. Any status other than "created" can be marked returned.
+  - `E_NOT_FOUND`: no shipment with that id
+  - `E_BAD_STATE`: shipment is still in status "created" (detail is the current status)
 
 ## rates
 
